DOC=The OnCalendar spec of the sweep.escape_census task's ticks in spira-runtime.
SCHEMA=REQUIRED: The OnCalendar spec of the sweep.escape_census task's ticks in spira-runtime. Declared by a spira-runtime task row written from its contract (wiki/projects/spira/designs/tasks/); its default is the contract's pin, which spira-config init writes on a fresh install and activation's config delta declares on an upgrade.
DEFAULT<<'SPIRA_CONF_DEFAULT_EOF'
    # The task contract's pin (wiki/projects/spira/designs/tasks/): spira-config init has no
    # answer to invent for a typed key, so a fresh install could not configure without it.
    : "${SPIRA_RUNTIME_SWEEP_ESCAPE_CENSUS_CALENDAR:=Mon *-*-* 06:15:00}"
SPIRA_CONF_DEFAULT_EOF
